<title>BULGARIA: SOCCER-BULGARIA V LUXEMBOURG TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BULGARIA V LUXEMBOURG TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>BOURGAS, Bulgaria 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for the World Cup European zone group five qualifier between Bulgaria and Luxembourg on Sunday:</p>
<p>Bulgaria: 1-Zdravko Zdravkov, 2-Anatoli Nankov, 3-Trifon Ivanov, 4-Ivailo Petkov, 5-Ivailo Yordanov, 6-Zlatko Yankov, 7-Emil Kostadinov, 8-Hristo Stoichkov, 9-Lyuboslav Penev, 10-Krasimir Balakov, 11-Ilian Iliev.</p>
<p>Luxembourg: 1-Paul Koch, 2-Jean Vanek, 3-Frank Deville, 4-Marc Birsens, 5-Luc Holtz, 6-Claude Ganser, 7-Guy Hellers, 8-Carlo Weis, 9-Roby Langers, 10-Manuel Cardoni, 11-Dany Theis.</p>
</text>
